<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27176" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διόλλῡμι</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διοικο-ύω</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Them.
			<u>Or.</u>
			32.356a
		</span></i>), fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ολέσω,</span>
		
			Att.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ολῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.):—<i>destroy utterly, bring to naught,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				139
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				442
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1028
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cri.</u>
				47c
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. γυναῖκα</span>
			<i>ruin</i> a woman, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				921
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, with fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ολοῦμαι,</span>
			pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όλωλα,</span>
			<i>perish utterly, come to naught,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.40
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διώλετο ἔκ τινος</span>
			by some one's hand, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				225
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>blot out of one's mind, forget,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰδὼς διώλεσα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				318
			</span></i>.</div>
